4. Make the events
The parent event is the whole survey. Each photo gets a child event. The photo event ID ends with the frame number.
survey_id &lt;- function(date) {
  paste(
    PROJECT_CODE, gsub("-", "", date), COUNTRY_ID_CODE, ISLAND_CODE,
    SITE_CODE, STRATA, sep = ":"
  )
}

group_code &lt;- function(group) {
  gsub("Group_", "G", group, fixed = TRUE)
}

frame_from_name &lt;- function(image_name) {
  stem &lt;- sub("\\.[^.]*$", "", image_name)
  frame &lt;- substr(stem, nchar(stem) - 3, nchar(stem))
  if (!grepl("^[0-9]{4}$", frame)) {
    stop("Cannot find a 4-digit frame number in ", image_name)
  }
  frame
}
The child event ID also includes the group, because the same frame number can appear in more than one group.


